{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121560","id":4087400620,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7zoMis","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121560","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121560.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121560.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121560","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121560/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121560/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121560/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0aa030587e1e637a541efd27874665438cce881d","number":121560,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Always set error.start_line in `GDScriptTokenizerText::string()`","user":{"login":"norepro","id":30921834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTIxODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30921834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro","html_url":"https://github.com/norepro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`GDScriptTokenizerText::string()` returns errors with line and column data but does not properly handle multi-line string tokens. It sets `start_column` to the column of the physical line but leaves `start_line` set to the start of the token (which may be a few lines up!) This leads to a line/column combination that reads beyond the bounds of the line, crashing the process.\r\n\r\nSet `start_line` to the current physical line whenever we set `start_column`.\r\n\r\n- Closes #121294 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used. Fix was simply finding every place `start_column` was assigned within the function and assigning `start_line` in kind.\r\n\r\nThis is my first time adding unit tests and went through a few iterations regarding layout and naming. I settled on `SUBCASE` with a lambda and descriptive names but am open to different layout suggestions.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.